    "title": "JAC-3959: Unlock executor capacity \u2014 lane certification and task routing",
    "description": "## Goal\nCertify all available Paperclip executor lanes and recommend 5+ independent unblocked tasks so the existing coordinator can dispatch more than one task per cycle.\n\n## Lane Certification Results (2026-07-30T23:00Z)\n\n### Healthy Lanes\n| Lane | Status | Models | Idle Agents |\n|------|--------|--------|-------------|\n| ollama_cloud | healthy | deepseek-v4-pro, deepseek-v4-flash, kimi-k3, glm-5.2 | 2 (3 configured, 1 running) |\n| ollama_local | healthy | qwen3-coder:30b | 3 (4 configured, 1 error) |\n| claude_local | healthy | opus-4-8, sonnet-4-6, sonnet-5, fable-5, mythos-5 | 7 (8 configured, 1 running) |\n| codex_local | healthy | gpt-5.6-sol (v0.142.5) | 1 |\n| opencode_local | healthy | ollama/qwen3-coder:30b (543 models) | 2 |\n| ringer_kimi | healthy | kimi-for-coding/k2p7 | 1 |\n| acpx_local | healthy | \u2014 | 0 |\n\n### Unavailable Lanes\n| Lane | Reason |\n|------|--------|\n| cursor | hello probe timeout |\n| cursor_cloud | CURSOR_API_KEY + repoUrl missing |\n| grok | CLI not installed |\n| gemini | no auth configured |\n| antigravity | TTY required (not headless) |\n| pi_local | no models returned |\n\n### Blockers\n- 3 agents in error state (Forge, Hermes Coder, Press) \u2014 MCPServerTask coroutine exceptions\n- Coordinator has 2 in_progress issues but is idle \u2014 workflow-state drift\n- Cursor hello probe times out\n\n## Recommended Tasks (unassigned, high priority, plan-backed)\n\n1. **JAC-3796** \u2014 Audit and remediate Paperclip agent configurations \u2192 claude_local (Herald/Researcher)\n2. **JAC-3705** \u2014 Canary efficient Hermes-local agents without losing memory \u2192 hermes_local/ollama-cloud (Hermes Mistral/Wings)\n3. **JAC-3678** \u2014 Deep-JSON scrape Fable 5 design tokens \u2192 claude_local (Analyst-Opus/Plan Runner)\n4. **JAC-3686** \u2014 Build oai-worker (OpenAI-first profile) \u2192 opencode_local (Coder Y/Aegis Coder X)\n5. **JAC-3685** \u2014 Build oai-coordinator (OpenAI-first profile) \u2192 opencode_local (Coder Y/Aegis Coder X)\n6. **JAC-3684** \u2014 Build oai-default (OpenAI-first profile) \u2192 opencode_local (Coder Y/Aegis Coder X)\n7. **JAC-3673** \u2014 Autonomous Paperclip org routing policy \u2192 claude_local (Herald/Researcher)\n8. **JAC-3596** \u2014 Independent exact-SHA verification of HOLD gates \u2192 claude_local (Sentry, already assigned)\n\n## Instructions for Coordinator\n- 34 idle agents across 7 healthy lanes\n- Dispatch up to 7 parallel tasks (one per lane)\n- Do not assign to error-state agents (Forge, Hermes Coder, Press)\n- Do not create new schedulers or cron jobs\n- Full receipt: docs/fleet/receipts/executor-lane-certification-v1-20260730T230000Z.json",
