: live parallel-session soak test (`maxConcurrentSessions=3`). Code is live and unit-verified; this is the remaining live verification that was intentionally not done from inside a same-agent heartbeat.\\n\\n**Worker:** Kimi Code via Ringer (`ringer_kimi` / pool `independent-review`, state=`verified`, free after JAC-4300 terminal)\\n\\n### Scope (independent verification / controlled soak \\u2014 not product implementation)\\nExecute the JAC-3269 soak checklist as a **read+controlled-mutation** verification with full rollback:\\n\\n1. Pick or create a **low-cost test agent** (or use an existing probe). Prefer `_test_probe` / disposable agent if suitable; do not hijack production specialists.\\n2. Set `runtimeConfig.maxConcurrentSessions=3` via PATCH `/api/agents/{id}` (record before/after).\\n3. Create 3 sessions and wake each.\\n4. Confirm 3 concurrent running heartbeat runs with distinct `session_id`.\\n5. Confirm two sessions cannot check out the same issue (second checkout \\u2192 409).\\n6. Confirm per-agent budget accounting aggregates across the 3 sessions (or document API limitation with evidence).\\n7. **Revert** `maxConcurrentSessions` to 1 and archive/cleanup test sessions.\\n\\n### Guardrails\\n- No credential rotation; no external messages; no production agent reconfiguration beyond the disposable soak target.\\n- Live API is `http://127.0.0.1:3101` (env `PAPERCLIP_API_URL` may still point at down `:3100`).\\n- If auth boundary blocks agent PATCH/session APIs, stop with a first-class blocker naming the missing permission \\u2014 do not invent PASS.\\n- Leave a structured soak receipt on this issue + mirror on JAC-3269.\\n\\n### Verification expected\\n- Pass/fail table for steps 1\\u20137 with run IDs / HTTP sta[...truncated]\n    \"status\": \"blocked\",\n    \"workMode\": \"standard\",\n    \"harnessKind\": null,\n    \"priority\": \"high\",\n    \"assigneeAgentId\": \"3f1712eb-7b43-40fa-b893-f36e92bb9ac3\",\n    \"assigneeUserId\": null,\n    \"check