    "title": "Prepare and execute Paperclip upgrade path (2026.626.0 \u2192 2026.707.0 stable)",
    "description": "## Goal\nUpgrade canonical Aegis Paperclip safely from **2026.626.0** to npm stable **2026.707.0** (or a later board-approved pin). Canary is currently **2026.717.0-canary.6** \u2014 not default.\n\n## Current production facts\n- Host: Aegis launchd `ai.paperclip` \u2192 `/Users/hermes/.hermes/node/bin/paperclipai run`\n- Mode: `local_trusted`, bind loopback `:3100`\n- Talaris client path: SSH tunnel `:3110`\n- Company: `87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7` (jack.digital)\n- Agents: 34 (dynamic; re-read before cutover)\n- DB/data: ~429MB embedded postgres + ~1.9G instance data; backups present under `~/.paperclip/instances/default/data/backups`\n- Talaris local paperclip LaunchAgents are disabled/bak; Aegis is sole server of record\n\n## Recommended path (NOT blind in-place)\n1. **Freeze**: no agent creates/adapter upgrades during cutover window; cancel unintended live-runs.\n2. **Fresh backup** on Aegis: `paperclipai db:backup --json` + copy latest `.sql.gz` off-box/Talaris.\n3. **Export roster/config**: agents list, company id, config.json (no secrets), health JSON.\n4. **Side-by-side smoke first (Talaris or Aegis alt port)**:\n   - install pin `2026.707.0` into an isolated prefix/worktree instance (different port, e.g. 3120)\n   - `paperclipai doctor`\n   - empty/smoke company OR restore backup into disposable instance\n   - verify adapter registry still includes `hermes_local`, `openclaw_gateway`, `pi_local`\n   - create throwaway agent + one issue run\n5. **Only then** upgrade Aegis package pin, restart launchd, health+company agents readback, one canary wake of a noncritical agent.\n6. Rollback plan: reinstall `2026.626.0`, restore backup, relaunch plist.\n\n## Explicit non-recommendation\nDo not spin a second long-lived production company on Talaris as the new SSOT. Side-by-side is for smoke only; Aegis remains authority unless Jack reverses host policy.\n\n## Deliverables\n- Preflight snapshot path\n- Backup path + sha256\n- Side-by-side health proof\n- Aegis post-upgrade health/version/agent count\n- Known regressions list\n",
