{"role":"tool","tool_call_id":"tool_ZJ257rEZBfr87jCCZggmDdJs","content":"{\n    \"id\": \"c80d3191-868c-4779-ab3f-9c605bb7daa7\",\n    \"companyId\": \"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7\",\n    \"projectId\": null,\n    \"projectWorkspaceId\": null,\n    \"goalId\": \"6eace62f-8d6f-4543-b419-75d98c7da6e9\",\n    \"parentId\": null,\n    \"title\": \"Prepare and execute Paperclip upgrade path (2026.626.0 \\u2192 2026.707.0 stable)\",\n    \"description\": \"## Goal\\nUpgrade canonical Aegis Paperclip safely from **2026.626.0** to npm stable **2026.707.0** (or a later board-approved pin). Canary is currently **2026.717.0-canary.6** \\u2014 not default.\\n\\n## Current production facts\\n- Host: Aegis launchd `ai.paperclip` \\u2192 `/Users/hermes/.hermes/node/bin/paperclipai run`\\n- Mode: `local_trusted`, bind loopback `:3100`\\n- Talaris client path: SSH tunnel `:3110`\\n- Company: `87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7` (jack.digital)\\n- Agents: 34 (dynamic; re-read before cutover)\\n- DB/data: ~429MB embedded postgres + ~1.9G instance data; backups present under `~/.paperclip/instances/default/data/backups`\\n- Talaris local paperclip LaunchAgents are disabled/bak; Aegis is sole server of record\\n\\n## Recommended path (NOT blind in-place)\\n1. **Freeze**: no agent creates/adapter upgrades during cutover window; cancel unintended live-runs.\\n2. **Fresh backup** on Aegis: `paperclipai db:backup --json` + copy latest `.sql.gz` off-box/Talaris.\\n3. **Export roster/config**: agents list, company id, config.json (no secrets), health JSON.\\n4. **Side-by-side smoke first (Talaris or Aegis alt port)**:\\n   - install pin `2026.707.0` into an isolated prefix/worktree instance (different port, e.g. 3120)\\n   - `paperclipai doctor`\\n   - empty/smoke company OR restore backup into disposable instance\\n   - verify adapter registry still includes `hermes_local`, `openclaw_gateway`, `pi_local`\\n   - create throwaway agent + one issue run\\n5. **Only then** upgrade Aegis package pin, restart launchd, health+company agents readback, one canary wake of a noncritical agent.\\n6. Rollback plan: reinstall `2026.626.0`, restore backup, relaunch plist.\\n\\n## Explicit non-recommendation\\nDo not spin a second long-lived production company on Talaris as the new SSOT. Side-by-side is for smoke only; Aegis remains authority unless Jack reverses host policy.\\n\\n## Deliverables\\n- Preflight snapshot path\\n- Backup path + sha256\\[...truncated]\n    \"status\": \"blocked\",\n    \"workMode\": \"standard\",\n    \"harnessKind\": null,\n    \"priority\": \"medium\",\n    \"assigneeAgentId\": \"2c6b1cc9-aad2-431b-93ea-e31f0612be65\",\n    \"assigneeUserId\": null,\n    \"checkoutRunId\": null,\n    \"executionRunId\": null,\n    \"executionAgentNameKey\": null,\n    \"executionLockedAt\": null,\n    \"createdByAgentId\": null,\n    \"createdByUserId\": \"local-board\",\n    \"responsibleUserId\": \"local-board\",\n    \"issueNumber\": 3662,\n    \"identifier\": \"JAC-3662\",\n    \"originKind\": \"manual\",\n    \"originId\": null,\n    \"originRunId\": null,\n    \"originFingerprint\": \"default\",\n    \"requestDepth\": 0,\n    \"billingCode\": null,\n    \"assigneeAdapterOverrides\": null,\n    \"executionPolicy\": null,\n    \"executionState\": null,\n    \"monitorNextCheckAt\": null,\n    \"monitorWakeRequestedAt\": null,\n    \"monitorLastTriggeredAt\": null,\n    \"monitorAttemptCount\": 0,\n    \"monitorNotes\": null,\n    \"monitorScheduledBy\": null,\n    \"executionWorkspaceId\": null,\n    \"executionWorkspacePreference\": null,\n    \"executionWorkspaceSettings\": null,\n    \"sourceTrust\": null,\n    \"startedAt\": \"2026-08-01T18:42:12.043Z\",\n    \"completedAt\": null,\n    \"cancelledAt\": null,\n    \"hiddenAt\": null,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-17T20:43:59.568Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-08-01T18:52:06.120Z\",\n    \"labels\": [],\n    \"labelIds\": [],\n    \"watchdog\": null,\n    \"ancestors\": [],\n    \"blocke