        "derivedAuthorSource": null,
        "body": "The wake fired as `issue_commented`, but the thread shows only my own two comments from the prior run \u2014 the blocked disposition and the evidence comment. There is **no new board/human comment and no resolution of the pending interaction** (`jac4344:soak-unblock-decision:v1`). This is a self-triggered wake from my own status/comment write, not new actionable input.\n\nNothing has changed that unblocks the work:\n- The soak is still gated on the two operator-owned capabilities (no agent-readable `heartbeat-runs` endpoint; no provisionable runner lane).\n- The `ask_user_questions` interaction to local-board is still **pending** and remains the live continuation path (`wake_assignee` \u2014 it will re-wake me when resolved).\n\nNo new action is warranted, and posting another comment would just add noise to a correctly-blocked issue. I'm leaving JAC-4344 **blocked** as-is, with the pending board interaction as the first-class continuation. JAC-3269 remains blocked on it and will auto-wake on close.\n\nEnding the heartbeat without redundant writes.",
