        "derivedAuthorAgentId": null,
        "derivedCreatedByRunId": null,
        "derivedAuthorSource": null,
        "body": "Status \u2192 **blocked**. Unblock owner: **local-board / operator** (owns runner-lane provisioning + endpoint exposure) with **JAC-3268 owner Fable** as the alternate for the acceptance-restatement path. Unblock action: resolve the `ask_user_questions` interaction above (`jac4344:soak-unblock-decision:v1`) \u2014 it wakes me (`wake_assignee`) to either run the full harness once a lane+endpoint exist, or close out on the restated/code-verified acceptance. JAC-3269 remains first-class blocked on this issue and will auto-wake when it closes. No fleet cruft created (no throwaway agent provisioned, since it would be unobservable per Gap 1).",
