\"identifier\": \"JAC-3662\",\n                    \"title\": \"Prepare and execute Paperclip upgrade path (2026.626.0 \\u2192 2026.707.0 stable)\",\n                    \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n                    \"priority\": \"medium\",\n                    \"assigneeAgentId\": \"2c6b1cc9-aad2-431b-93ea-e31f0612be65\",\n                    \"assigneeUserId\": null\n                },\n                \"mentionCount\": 1,\n                \"sources\": [\n                    {\n                        \"kind\": \"description\",\n\n=== JAC-4216 ===\n{\n    \"id\": \"7ed3f97e-dca2-4862-95bb-8755a081b429\",\n    \"companyId\": \"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7\",\n    \"projectId\": \"f99704da-43b5-4cf7-89ef-13f59a348d90\",\n    \"projectWorkspaceId\": \"e7c82685-adcf-43b2-b2dd-9c229884be3e\",\n    \"goalId\": null,\n    \"parentId\": \"4651b061-fc84-4c1b-beb7-d99639fc0eb0\",\n    \"title\": \"DECISION (Jack): re-enable ollama-cloud as autonomous tier-2? (JAC-3673 enforcement)\",\n    \"description\": \"Re-scoped per board request (JAC-3673 comment) to hold **only** enforcement decision #1. Decision #2 (adapter migration) split into its own sibling issue.\\n\\nEnforcement follow-up to **JAC-3673** (routing policy \\u2014 done, ratified). This is a **human authorization call** \\u2014 an autonomous agent must not self-authorize it.\\n\\n## The decision\\nRe-enable **ollama-cloud** as the autonomous ladder's **tier-2** (`local \\u2192 ollama-cloud \\u2192 OpenAI \\u2192 Claude`)?\\n- Quota restored ~18:59 CDT 2026-07-19, but cloud routes stayed removed (P0 **hermes-qds0**) and re-enabling was **NOT authorized** in the 07-19 session.\\n\\n## If authorized \\u2014 required steps before any config change\\n1. **Re-probe live** \\u2014 never trust `hermes auth status` (reports \\\"logged in\\\" for quota-exhausted/401 creds). Use the disposable-profile method in `docs/provider-liveness-probe-method-2026-07-18.md`.\\n2. **Verify the Talaris half of hermes-qds0** \\u2014 never verified; stale cloud routes there would silently resume metering the moment quota is live.\\n3. Add ollama-cloud to the `local-first` ladder in `scripts/provider_first_profile.py`.\\n\\nOnce Jack rules \\\"yes\\\", any agent can pick this up and execute under explicit authorization.\\n\\nRefs: JAC-3673 (policy, done), bd memory `paperclip-autonomous-routing-policy`, hermes-qds0.\",\n    \"status\": \"todo\",\n    \"workMode\": \"standard\",\n    \"harnessKind\": null,\n    \"priority\": \"high\",\n    \"assigneeAgentId\": null,\n    \"assigneeUserId\": \"local-board\",\n    \"checkoutRunId\": null,\n    \"executionRunId\": null,\n    \"executionAgentNameKey\": null,\n    \"executionLockedAt\": null,\n    \"createdByAgentId\": \"a1e8cb0d-9132-4b3b-b7a3-8b53cdb10708\",\n    \"createdByUserId\": null,\n    \"responsibleUserId\": null,\n    \"issueNumber\": 4216,\n    \"identifier\": \"JAC-4216\",\n    \"originKind\": \"manual\",\n    \"originId\": null,\n    \"originRunId\": null,\n    \"originFingerprint\": \"default\",\n    \"requestDepth\": 0,\n    \"billingCode\": null,\n    \"assigneeAdapterOverrides\": null,\n    \"executionPolicy\": null,\n    \"executionState\": null,\n    \"monitorNextCheckAt\": null,\n    \"monitorWakeRequestedAt\": null,\n    \"monitorLastTriggeredAt\": null,\n    \"monitorAttemptCount\": 0,\n    \"monitorNotes\": null,\n    \"monitorScheduledBy\": null,\n    \"executionWorkspaceId\": \"7c602481-db2f-4402-a6cb-1ddfd5105674\",\n    \"executionWorkspacePreference\": \"reuse_existing\",\n    \"executionWorkspaceSettings\": {\n        \"mode\": \"isolated_workspace\"\n    },\n    \"sourceTrust\": null,\n    \"startedAt\": null,\n    \"completedAt\": null,\n    \"cancelledAt\": null,\n    \"hiddenAt\": null,\n    \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-31T20:55:19.256Z\",\n    \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-31T20:57:32.321Z\",\n    \"labels\": [],\n    \"labelIds\": [],\n    \"watchdog\": null,\n    \"ancestors\": [\n        {\n            \"id\": \"465