ble lifecycle state; ContextForge indexes and disambiguates; Hermes provides the active agent runtime.\\n\\n## Connections\\n- [Onboarding](/projects/60bf492f-74ce-4084-83c9-d80c5f8bfaa9) \\u2014 fleet induction\\n- [Sea Ranch AI](/projects/3edbceaa-842b-4cbd-8a2d-a06b9264db86), [Echo Springs](/projects/97c2505c-53bb-4975-964f-0a5f6780b419), and [Health](/projects/24790c7e-0ab5-403c-89da-e13b0a460ea7) \\u2014 downstream operational domains\\n- Paperclip MCP provides operational query/write access. ContextForge MCP provides shared pointer/index access; it does not create native Paperclip project relations.\\n\\n**Stable project ID:** `f99704da-43b5-4cf7-89ef-13f59a348d90`\",\n                \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n                \"goalId\": null,\n                \"workspaces\": [\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"e7c82685-adcf-43b2-b2dd-9c229884be3e\",\n                        \"companyId\": \"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7\",\n                        \"projectId\": \"f99704da-43b5-4cf7-89ef-13f59a348d90\",\n                        \"name\": \"Agentic OS Local\",\n                        \"cwd\": \"/Users/hermes/Projects/agentic-os\",\n                        \"repoUrl\": null,\n                        \"repoRef\": null,\n                        \"metadata\": null,\n                        \"isPrimary\": true,\n                        \"createdAt\": \"2026-07-14T18:15:00.742Z\",\n                        \"updatedAt\": \"2026-07-29T23:25:04.762Z\"\n                    },\n                    {\n                        \"id\": \"7bfd1b45-9399-416d-89fb-7d848945b0e7\",\n                        \"companyId\": \"87c32b8e-f131-4df8-ad8e-963d01b458e7\",\n                        \"projectId\": \"f99704da-43b5-4cf7-89ef-13f59a348d90\",\n                        \"name\": \"Agentic OS Talaris\",\n                        \"cwd\": \"/Users/jack.reis/Projects/agentic-os\",\n                        \"repoUrl\": null,\n                        \